abstract: >-
  MathModDB MCP server for semantic ontology exploration and
  SPARQL querying. Provides tools for schema discovery
  (Explore_Ontology), single SPARQL query execution
  (SPARQL_Query), and batch SPARQL query execution
  (Batch_SPARQL_Query) against the MathModDB knowledge graph.
